Package: keenetic-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.3), curl, jq, coreutils, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fzf
Description: inspect Keenetic routers and manage client policies
 Shows router, VPN, Wi-Fi, traffic, and client status with live views and
 diagnostics. Applies verified client policies, Internet blocks, interface
 state changes, and Wake-on-LAN actions through the Keenetic RCI API.
